5,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I’m worried about who pays for what. Last time it was a mess. I want clear rules.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I need to know the total cost before we commit. No surprises later.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want to understand why we felt crowded or alone last year. It’s about us.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Travel time eats the week. I need to see how much time is lost moving.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I sleep badly away from home. I need to know about baths and quiet spots.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, if we rent a whole house, the bill is one number. That’s fair.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, one bill is good, but I need to know if food is included.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, if the travel is too long, we lose the point of being together.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, I agree. I’m checking the ferry and train times to see the loss.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, I’m checking the bathing hours. I need to know when I can wash.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I’ll check the pricing of offshore houses and what separately booked rooms cost last time.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I’ll check the all-in rates against meals bought separately and the valley inn rates.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I’ll check the time alone in the shared-house year and how last year's days ran.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I’ll check the ferry sailings and train time and getting around by train and bus.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll check the bathing hours and bathroom provision and inn mealtimes and room arrangements.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
