60,3,1,talk,Sakura,,Option A is the island. Option B is the city. Option C is the hot spring town.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,Option C has a fixed rate. I like the certainty.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Midori,,Option C keeps us together. Option B lets us drift.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option C is the fastest travel. Option A is too slow.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option B has private rooms. Option C has shared rooms. I am worried.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, in Option C, you share a room. In Option B, you are alone.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, Option C is 17,000 yen. Option B is 12,000 to 20,000 plus food.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Victoria, I care more about us being together than the exact yen amount.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, I agree. The ninety-minute train is a huge win for Option C.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, but the bath is shared. I need to know if I can sleep.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, the inn has a door to the room, but you share the space.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, if you can't sleep, the trip is ruined. But the cost is safe.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, we can talk to the inn. Maybe there is a quiet corner.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, the bus stops early. We can't wander late. But we are together.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I think I can manage the shared room if the bath is good.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Sakura,,I vote for Option C. The cost is fair and we are together.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,I vote for Option C. The all-in rate protects my budget.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Midori,,"I vote for Option C. I want us to be together, not drifting.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I vote for Option C. The travel time is minimal.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I vote for Option C. I hope the room is quiet enough.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
